What is the output of the following Java program implementing the Decorator pattern?
```java
interface TextOutput {
    String format(String text);
}
class SimpleText implements TextOutput {
    public String format(String text) { return text; }
}
class BracketDecorator implements TextOutput {
    private TextOutput wrapped;
    public BracketDecorator(TextOutput wrapped) { this.wrapped = wrapped; }
    public String format(String text) { return "[" + wrapped.format(text) + "]"; }
}
public class DecoratorApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        TextOutput t = new BracketDecorator(new BracketDecorator(new SimpleText()));
        System.out.println(t.format("data"));
    }
}
```
